                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Buggy game attached to a funny story. They sometimes do too much Family Guy-esque comedy, but there are enough funny moments to watch a Let's Play. My personal favorite was King Cat and the red laser.\n\nAfter you reach a certain point in the game, you start fighting enemies who are immune to all weapons not made to hurt them. If playing single player, you are required to use that weapon type for the rest of the game, which is terrible design. There are too many stages for a Beat 'Em Up without character progression. Me and my friend got tired of the game after 5 hours in, wondering when it would end.\n\nI didn't encounter any bugs that prevented stage progression, but Online Play was inconsistent. Some moments were a little laggy, and some moments required either me or my friend to play through a level while the other was dead. The game would be perfectly average and lightly recommended if the online multiplayer and bugs were fixed.\n\nI give this game \"Loot, loot, loot, loot!\" out of 10",
                        "timestamp_created": 1783070273,
